  m_Name: RiverHoverDock
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BuildingDefinition
  id: RiverHoverDock
  displayName: Hover Dock
  description: A landing pad of glowing rings and a dome hangar, a hover-barge humming
    above the pad. Trains Hover-Barges; its ferry seats 12. Build it on the shore
    of open water. Its boats patrol the water and shoot at raiders near the shore;
    send troops to land the water cuts off and its ferry carries them across.
